        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 Bedroom beachside residence extending to c.1,000sqft and presented in excellent condition throughout.\r\n\r\nSituated in the family friendly Sandycove Development and occupying a desirable East - West orientation, this convenient townhouse is the ideal starter home, coastal bolthole or right-sizer's dream.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor features a sizable kitchen/dining area with bay window and galley style kitchen. Double doors lead into the comfortable sitting room with its open fireplace and double doors opening onto the patio and lawn area. 2 separate store rooms on the ground floor offer ample space for space/utility area/pantry etc...\r\n\r\nThe first floor is laid out with one single and two double bedrooms along with a bathroom. The master bedroom is ensuite and features access on to the balcony area via sliding doors. All bedrooms boast sea views on the first floor.\r\n\r\nTo the rear of the property is a paved patio and direct access onto the communal gardens. A barna shed offers exterior storage for kayaks/wetsuits etc and is a convenient asset.\r\n\r\nThe  Sandycove development has matures into a warm and friendly collective of both full-time and part-time residents. This gated complex is located directly across from Owenahincha beach and features resident and guest parking areas, a communal playroom, and kids playground. The annual management fee of €750 covers year round landscaping, bin collection, maintenance and upkeep of common areas and lighting.\r\n\r\nThis is a most attractive and well kept family home with a wonderful convenient coastal location located in a welcoming and warm village environment.\r\n\r\nServices: Gas Heating, Mains Water, Mains Drainage, Electricity, Broadband\r\n\r\nRosscarbery 5mins Drive, Clonakilty 10 mins Drive, Cork City & Airport 1hr Drive"
      },
